.","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AC06686B44F2537","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422216004:0":{"text":"뭐? 말을 한다고! 전엔 그런 기능이 없었는데? 누가 또 언어 모듈을 추가한 거야!","source_cn":"啊？在说话！之前没有这个功能啊？谁又给它们加上了语言模块！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43E58AE927FEC5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422216005:0":{"text":"그건...","source_cn":"这个的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49FB776649C7907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422216006:0":{"text":"저희 생각엔...","source_cn":"我们觉得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D142B901107121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422216007:0":{"text":"기계 수비병 법칙 1, 기계 수비병이 달릴 수 있다면 시스템에 함부로 손대지 말 것!","source_cn":"机械守卫第一法则，只要机械守卫能跑起来，就不要乱动它的系统！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2761EFFE413A7E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422216008:0":{"text":"이렇게 개조하다간 점점 더 이상해질 거야!","source_cn":"你们这样改造下去，它们会越来越奇怪的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F856F0D8EA23F6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422216009:0":{"text":"기계 수비병의 경계 시스템이 원래대로 돌아오면 모든 게 정상으로 작동할 거야.","source_cn":"我相信，只要它们的警戒系统恢复原状，一切都会变得正常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB6C744654C9D997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422216010:0":{"text":"수정해야 할 건 전투 시스템이야!","source_cn":"要改的是你的作战系统！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07AC9ACFAFDF3CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422216011:0":{"text":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","source_cn":"……我想起我和我的顾问还有些事，就先不打扰了，你说是吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x96CB8132A7FB65E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","female":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","variant_male_record_index":"164085","variant_female_record_index":"164086","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1422216011":{"text":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","source_cn":"……我想起我和我的顾问还有些事，就先不打扰了，你说是吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x96CB8132A7FB65E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","female":"...나랑 내 고문은 볼 일이 있으니까 이만 가봐야 할 것 같아. 그치?","variant_male_record_index":"164085","variant_female_record_index":"164086","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422216012:1":{"text":"진짜 수고했어! 내가 영지의 수레로 너희들을 데려다줄게! 다음에 또 놀러 와!","source_cn":"真是麻烦你们了！我带你们坐营地的矿车，送你们出去！欢迎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A122831C9A59585","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422216013:1":{"text":"저 두 사람은 그냥 영원히 저렇게 싸우게 두면 돼...","source_cn":"至于他俩，就让他们永无止境地吵下去吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1D18386CC5C51D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"고개를 끄덕인다","source_cn":"点点头","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A964DC8395D753","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고개를 끄덕인다","female":"고개를 끄덕인다","variant_male_record_index":"72746","variant_female_record_index":"72747","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:1:2":{"text":"눈을 깜빡거린다","source_cn":"眨眨眼睛","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10353729DB387139","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"눈을 깜빡거린다","female":"눈을 깜빡거린다","variant_male_record_index":"72748","variant_female_record_index":"72749","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人维修工托格":{"text":"드워프 수리공 토그","source":"矮人维修工托格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:谨慎的矮人机械师":{"text":"신중한 드워프 기계공학가","source":"谨慎的矮人机械师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆大的矮人机械师":{"text":"대담한 드워프 기계공학가","source":"胆大的矮人机械师","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":17,"locali